{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/majestine-damac-properties-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":333,"crm_id":"2264","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Majestine","slug":"majestine-damac-properties-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["hotel-apartments"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":2477000,"display_price":"2.477M","lattitude":25.186457,"longitude":55.2794801,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Majestine is a premium project from Damac Properties, which presents a 20-story majestic tower-a beautiful example of modern urban architecture in Dubai. The complex is located in the prestigious and vibrant Business Bay area.</p><p>We offer our customers more than 300 luxury furnished apartments, fully equipped and ready to move in. The <strong>studios</strong>, as well as <strong>one-, two - and three-bedroom apartments</strong>, are designed and thought out down to the smallest detail, ready to move in. The living spaces are decorated in pale gold tones with small accents of royal blue, which add a regal atmosphere.</p><p>Majestine offers a grandiose lifestyle that combines the refined comforts of home with the superb service of a luxury hotel. Each apartment will give you a rare living experience. High-end amenities and stunning views of Dubai Creek will not leave anyone indifferent. An elegant lobby, access to a well-equipped gym and swimming pool, beautiful relaxation areas, and a SPA-all contribute to a serene rest and enjoyment. In the immediate vicinity of the Majestine complex there are a huge number of restaurants and cafes, as well as retail outlets and boutiques of the world's best brands.</p><p>Located in the \"platinum square kilometer\" area of Dubai's Burj, Majestine Apartments is serviced and operated by DAMAC Maison Hotels &amp; Resorts.</p><p>The excellent location of the Majestic complex allows you to reach The Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa, Jumeirah Beach in 9 minutes, and Dubai International Airport in 15 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2264/images/2024/06/24/Ngdy1iDSgi4zK35u9qWKRA9rGx6dWIflcAFyxTOt.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/24/Ngdy1iDSgi4zK35u9qWKRA9rGx6dWIflcAFyxTOt.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2264/images/2024/06/24/Lc19ojEVMKoU5y6Dcsx7zdWStRxHOxjtxvnWE9Ho.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/24/Lc19ojEVMKoU5y6Dcsx7zdWStRxHOxjtxvnWE9Ho.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2264/images/2024/06/24/gTTzyn4x8jMrtD8px7TyuTlZyWIeJsAfnlqeqec3.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/24/gTTzyn4x8jMrtD8px7TyuTlZyWIeJsAfnlqeqec3.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2264/images/2024/06/24/suNjLyQ6ndkmy69JGSlyhkwr1bbqPKj1pCqgbakH.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/24/suNjLyQ6ndkmy69JGSlyhkwr1bbqPKj1pCqgbakH.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2713,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/24/sRHgnFEPh3daZCuPh0ATV2zyN1hQZjrlSjrnsDgF.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1553,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1653,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1654,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1655,